:"%u","content":"你要去哪？","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801144,"trial_step":144},{"step":146,"speaker":"000","content":"嗯~先随便逛逛，顺便挑个喜欢的房间。哦对了，还有——","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801145,"trial_step":145},{"step":147,"content":"少女转过头，是你最熟悉的狂妄笑容。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801146,"trial_step":146},{"step":148,"speaker":"000","content":"禁闭者？暗网黑客？可怜小孩儿？哼，别拿那种眼神看我。这些词框定不了我，这里也困不住我。","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_147"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801147,"trial_step":147},{"step":149,"speaker":"000","content":"我是谁，跟你们所有人都没关系——只有我自己能决定！略略略！","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_148"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801148,"trial_step":148},{"step":150,"content":"对话的最后，少女扮了个鬼脸，趁着混乱毫不犹豫地转身离开。只留你一个人在审查室里目瞪口呆。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801149,"trial_step":149},{"step":151,"speaker":"小文","content":"局长，您这里没出事儿吧？","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_152"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801150,"trial_step":150},{"step":152,"options":["我没事，先处理警报"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801151,"trial_step":151,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我没事，先处理警报","goto":152}]},{"step":153,"speaker":"小文","content":"您没事就好！我们已经全面检查过了，事故并不严重，管理局系统很快就能修复完成——","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_155"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801152,"trial_step":152},{"step":154,"content":"应急预案启动，异动在你的指挥下迅速平复。小文松了口气，后知后觉地发现不对劲。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801153,"trial_step":153},{"step":155,"speaker":"小文","content":"咦，您刚刚在审查的禁闭者哪里去了？","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_156"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801154,"trial_step":154},{"step":156,"speaker":"000","content":"我是谁，跟你们所有人都没关系——只有我自己能决定！略略略！","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_148"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801155,"trial_step":155},{"step":157,"content":"你已经有一段时间没见过这样行事毫无章法，恣意妄为的家伙了。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801156,"trial_step":156},{"step":158,"content":"可没来由地，你只觉得有些好笑，有些怀念。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801157,"trial_step":157},{"step":159,"options":["不用管她"],"style":6,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801158,"trial_step":158,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"不用管她","goto":159}]},{"step":160,"speaker":"%u","content":"她应该不会跑远……嗯。大概吧。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801159,"trial_step":159},{"step":161,"content":"【黑屏过渡】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801160,"trial_step":160},{"step":162,"content":"【切换场景，回到纯白空间】","style":18,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801161,"trial_step":161},{"step":163,"speaker":"梦中的少女","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_160"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801162,"trial_step":162},{"step":164,"content":"梦中，你再一次遇到了那个令你无比怀恋的身影。","style":3,"background":4318,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801163,"trial_step":163},{"step":165,"content":"与白天那副满身是刺、拒绝沟通的态度不同，你能感觉到她就在你身后，靠着你的肩膀。你甚至能感觉到她的体温。","style":3,"background":4318,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801164,"trial_step":164},{"step":166,"content":"可当你试图抓住少女时，她又轻轻向后一跃，让你扑了个空。","style":3,"background":4318,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801165,"trial_step":165},{"step":167,"speaker":"梦中的少女","content":"……嘻嘻…………","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_164"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":4318,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801166,"trial_step":166},{"step":168,"content":"像是有意在逗弄你，少女发出一串笑声，亲近又狡黠。","style":3,"background":4318,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801167,"trial_step":167},{"step":169,"content":"你转过头，却看不清她的脸，只有那一连串的笑声令你感到无奈又欣慰。","style":3,"background":4318,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801168,"trial_step":168},{"step":170,"content":"可很快，笑声变成了另外一种东西，一种刺耳、机械的噪音，一种……警报？","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801169,"trial_step":169},{"step":171,"speaker":"机械音","content":"警报——系统错误——系统错误——","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_168"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":11,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801170,"trial_step":170},{"step":172,"content":"你睁开眼，震耳欲聋的警报声搞得你睡意全无。你下意识看向墙上的钟，发现此时距离你睡下才过去了一个半小时。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801171,"trial_step":171},{"step":173,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，管理局服务器再次受到攻击，生活区部分功能陷入瘫痪……","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_170"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801172,"trial_step":172},{"step":174,"speaker":"%u","content":"……知道了，我现在就去办公室。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801173,"trial_step":173},{"step":175,"content":"你艰难地从床上爬起来，长长地叹了口气，披上外套，快步离开房间。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130801174,"trial_step":174}]}